<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Trident Microsystems.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Trident Microsystems.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said it raised its rating of Trident Microsystems Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- said it set a six-month price target of $27 a share and a 12-month price target of $32 a share.</p>
<p>-- Trident gained 1-1/4 to 18-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
